<title>USA: TABLE- Southern New England Telecom Q2 net.</title>
<headline>TABLE- Southern New England Telecom Q2 net.</headline>
<dateline>NEW HAVEN, Conn. 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.76		    $0.77</p>
<p> Net			 50,000		   50,500</p>
<p> Revs and sales	 501,600		  487,800</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  65,999		   65,626</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>6  MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr			  $1.40		    $1.57</p>
<p> Net			 92,400		  102,700</p>
<p> Revs and sales	 984,300		  961,800</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  65,922		   65,505</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTES: 1997 six months net includes charge of $3.7 million, or $0.06 per share.</p>
<p>Full name of the company is Southern New England Telecommunications Corp.</p>
<p>Q2 earnings were in line with the First Call consensus estimate of $0.76 per share.</p>
<p>-- E. Auchard, New York newsdesk, ((212-859-1712))</p>
